OL,3,ASuspect in deadly Paris suburb shooting
OL,4,Asent for psychiatric observation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man suspected of a deadly gun attack
OL,7,Fnear Paris has left custody and been
OL,8,Fplaced under psychiatric observation,
OL,9,FFrench anti-terrorism officials have
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FOne person was killed and five others
OL,13,Finjured on Friday when an attacker
OL,14,Fopened fire from his car - first in
OL,15,FTrappes, and then in nearby La Verriere
OL,16,F- appearing to target people of migrant
OL,17,Forigin.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
