OL,3,ASuspect in deadly Paris suburb shooting
OL,4,Asent for psychiatric observation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe suspect, named in French media as
OL,7,F39-year-old Kevin T, will be observed
OL,8,Fto evaluate whether his "psychiatric
OL,9,Fhealth is compatible with pursuing his
OL,10,Finterrogation", the National
OL,11,FAnti-Terrorist Prosecutor's Office
OL,12,F(PNAT) said.
OL,14,FPresident Emmanuel Macron called it a
OL,15,F"racist terrorist attack", adding that
OL,16,Fpeople had been targeted over their
OL,17,Fskin colour or religion.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
